@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = password

### Browse mappings
GET {{baseUrl}}/__admin/mappings
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Browse request history
GET {{baseUrl}}/__admin/requests
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Reload file-backed mappings after editing them outside the UI
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/mappings/reset
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Reset stateful scenarios without deleting mappings
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/scenarios/reset
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Set a global fixed delay for all stubs
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/settings
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fixedDelay": 500
}

### Clear the global fixed delay
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/settings
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fixedDelay": 0
}
